<% layout("/layouts/auth") %>

<div class="row mt-5 mb-5">
  <div class="col-lg-8 offset-lg-2">
    <div class="card shadow-sm border-0 rounded-4 p-4 p-md-5">
      <a
        href="/"
        class="text-dark text-decoration-none mb-3 d-inline-flex align-items-center gap-2"
        aria-label="Back to home"
      >
        <svg
          xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
          width="24"
          height="24"
          fill="currentColor"
          viewBox="0 0 16 16"
        >
          <path
            fill-rule="evenodd"
            d="M15 8a.5.5 0 0 0-.5-.5H2.707l3.147-3.146a.5.5 0 1 0-.708-.708l-4 4a.5.5 0 0 0 0 .708l4 4a.5.5 0 0 0 .708-.708L2.707 8.5H14.5A.5.5 0 0 0 15 8z"
          />
        </svg>
        <span>Back</span>
      </a>

      <h1 class="fw-bold mb-1">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-muted mb-4">Last updated: October 25, 2026</p>

      <p>
        Wanderlust is a travel listings platform built as a portfolio project.
        This policy explains what information we collect, how we use it, and the
        choices you have.
      </p>

      <hr class="my-4" />

      <h5 class="fw-semibold">1. Information we collect</h5>
      <p class="mb-2">
        When you create an account or log in, we collect and store:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Your username</li>
        <li>Your email address</li>
        <li>
          A Google account identifier, if you choose "Continue with Google"
        </li>
        <li>The listings and reviews you post on Wanderlust</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        If you sign up with a username and password, your password is stored
        only as a secure hash. If you use Google login, we never receive or
        store your Google password.
      </p>

      <h5 class="fw-semibold mt-4">2. How we use your information</h5>
      <p>
        We use your information only to create and manage your account, let you
        log in, and show your listings and reviews on the site. We do not use it
        for advertising.
      </p>

      <h5 class="fw-semibold mt-4">3. Google user data</h5>
      <p>
        Wanderlust requests only your basic Google profile information (name and
        email address) to sign you in. This data is used solely for
        authentication and is not shared, sold, or used for any other purpose.
      </p>

      <h5 class="fw-semibold mt-4">4. Cookies</h5>
      <p>
        We use a session cookie to keep you logged in. It does not track you
        across other websites.
      </p>

      <h5 class="fw-semibold mt-4">5. Data sharing and storage</h5>
      <p>
        We do not sell or share your personal information with third parties.
        Your data is stored in a secured cloud database, and the site is hosted
        on a cloud hosting provider.
      </p>

      <h5 class="fw-semibold mt-4">6. Your choices</h5>
      <p>
        You can request access to, correction of, or deletion of your account
        and data at any time by contacting us at the email below.
      </p>

      <h5 class="fw-semibold mt-4">7. Changes to this policy</h5>
      <p>
        We may update this policy from time to time. The "Last updated" date at
        the top shows when it was last changed.
      </p>

      <div class="bg-light rounded-3 p-3 mt-4">
        <h5 class="fw-semibold mb-1">Contact us</h5>
        <p class="mb-0">
          For any privacy-related questions or requests, email
          <a href="mailto:praveenkumarprakash8@gmail.com" class="fw-semibold"
            >praveenkumarprakash8@gmail.com</a
          >.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
